# Backend Rules

- Use the Django ORM for database access.
- Use Django REST Framework for REST APIs.
- Use serializers for input and output validation.
- Keep substantial business logic out of views.
- Database schema changes require Django migrations. Commit migration files.
- User-owned resources must eventually be scoped to the authenticated user.
- Do not modify another backend domain without a reason.
